      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        0
      ],
      "text": "The guards stopped moving as Melos began to speak.",
      "text_sha256": "832cf0b17704a85bc72b2efa5726afed83e9a8c3d830b4aac8ef8fef60eab2f5",
      "word_count": 9,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c2",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "\"You give people no fair trial before killing them,\"",
      "text_sha256": "b88a14d91ecbff578e0e10356ad694e5d359f7a0efc45086f56681f915edc0b7",
      "word_count": 9,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c3",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "he told the ruler.",
      "text_sha256": "043a02c8cfb9a21e96a343b26d80257cddbf6160d01383eb959053298ca3a72e",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c4",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "\"If someone scares you, you order his death.\"",
      "text_sha256": "e36fd5bca58ad6a0e6fc89f9e6423db222307a7fc2598d2ca7716089d850b9f3",
      "word_count": 8,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c5",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "text": "The shepherd faced the ruler alone in dusty sandals, trying to hide his fear. The ruler narrowed his eyes.",
      "text_sha256": "0b30ef6470083d67a06437e6c786418d1a0cd7c04329ea1a3dba44a03ff092df",
      "word_count": 19,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c6",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "\"You will die too.\"",
      "text_sha256": "3edfd369e924e3f9d64723f71cc412f7dc3b56d958964f24779549f5a2c2a11a",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c6.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c7",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "text": "His stomach felt tight.",
      "text_sha256": "fd40521c17ccd076c7836bc4c0a6877604b66daf5dd84357a79cf5b986e39ca4",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c7.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c8",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "text": "\"May I have three days for my sister's wedding?\"",
      "text_sha256": "040a7afbf4fbb78ea12aad476077452d2ed2f48dbfebcf9885aec59024c009a5",
      "word_count": 9,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c8.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c9",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "text": "he asked.",
      "text_sha256": "63b53cde81ff6b2a19d765412157f166bf4121e542a401850374747f0f3fb8f2",
      "word_count": 2,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c9.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c10",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "text": "\"Then I'll come back.\"",
      "text_sha256": "85beb354258b380c1c7d1ef9a837849003edcfe73dfdd1616c4b56037b3f110b",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c10.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c11",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "text": "Laughing, the ruler asked,",
      "text_sha256": "44f76ecd32155f5db87b626c9b74503dd7d5f3bff4d2a2751dcb2f2b2eba9051",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c11.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c12",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "text": "\"Back to die?\"",
      "text_sha256": "fabc1e8c8bb879f6509d1e256c12ec95d517ab4e8b2ef79805c8beef0a6c3758",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c12.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c13",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "text": "\"My friend can take my place here.\"",
      "text_sha256": "1bc6144632b1591651c4ba10ef8d9d8db59b82f8f8dcc729aad151ca4e9eb103",
      "word_count": 7,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c13.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c14",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "text": "His friend silently stepped up. The ruler watched both as if looking for a trick.",
      "text_sha256": "8bd76a0bbf36f3a2c8c54e3f72b0868c084cbc287b9c3b7c6361c8924a1cf6e6",
      "word_count": 15,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c14.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c15",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "\"Return before sunset on day three,\"",
      "text_sha256": "c5641152b2c6e8a875bfbb388394bd508f8983a320ad44cfe9eaf96e52e5f0ae",
      "word_count": 6,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c15.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c16",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "he finally said.",
      "text_sha256": "e145a9dbc9a9e0b1ef107c657d1d349ca8263197eb40b57d3e9d5a3911b6c5ca",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c16.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c17",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "\"Your friend dies if you're late.\"",
      "text_sha256": "2b24ce2f6729c1772277fa5de15a25894ceb4cdcbf8e51c1525d1a96ee402f76",
      "word_count": 6,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c17.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c18",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "text": "His friend's warm, steady fingers closed around Melos's hand.",
      "text_sha256": "1afb72007021fb2cb2ba1585793c80e7216314af855b63f8dccbcd4322a276bc",
      "word_count": 9,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c18.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c19",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "friend",
      "speaker": "friend",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:friend",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "text": "\"Leave now. I'll wait for you.\"",
      "text_sha256": "527113703ee8768f845734ab88f7758738522d9030370d30156eba586ea19c4c",
      "word_count": 6,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c19.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c20",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "text": "His sister's smiles made Melos smile at her wedding. He watched her take her husband's hands. But he looked at the door whenever a shadow crossed the floor. Time moved on. He left for the city before dawn on day three.",
      "text_sha256": "fc6b8fc09f536d77f8d28f315f2b1521ee4fad7d09002cd2fc0bc78abe9b3376",
      "word_count": 41,
      "split_reason": "comment_or_scene_boundary(呼び出し側指定のforce_split_before_paragraphs)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c20.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c1",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        14,
        15,
        16,
        17,
        18,
        19
      ],
      "text": "He stopped walking at the river. There was no bridge left. Brown water rushed through the crossing with broken branches. Rain had flooded the river. He searched the banks but found no other crossing. Melos took a step into the river. The current knocked him down, filling his mouth with muddy water. He fought towards the far bank, reaching for a passing branch. He caught it, held tight, and pulled himself ashore. Shaking, he got up and ran on.",
      "text_sha256": "f2af8e8f09dc3b05530d7aac17a94993e8301d7fab41df1e4f1f63887843059e",
      "word_count": 79,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避); word_count_guideline_auto_split(前半、元178語がhard_avoid_words=150語を超過したため最も近い段落境界で自動分割)",
      "warnings": [
        "auto_split_hard_avoid_exceeded(original_word_count=178)"
      ],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c2",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        20,
        21,
        22,
        23,
        24,
        25,
        26,
        27
      ],
      "text": "Past the river, attackers blocked his way. One grabbed his arm; another swung a stick. Melos hit back, escaped, and stumbled past. They shouted angrily behind him, but he never looked back. Every step hurt by that afternoon. His legs suddenly failed him. On the ground, face down, he could not even stand. The distant city was still beyond reach. Perhaps he could stay here. Until sunset, nobody would find him. He would live, although his friend would die. For one terrible moment, that idea made him feel better. Then he remembered his friend's warm fingers holding his hand.",
      "text_sha256": "b530e412b0cec84953b89bbef69ca8e2faf665397a37dd3ca81e982a05191dd4",
      "word_count": 99,
